<header class="wb-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-hero-grid"><div class="wb-hero-text"><div class="wb-hero-eyebrow"><img src="https://info.propertylist.es/og/icon-default.png" alt="" /><span>New: AI website assistant &middot; Built for Spanish agencies</span></div><h1 class="wb-hero-h1">Your agency website,<br /><em>live in minutes.</em></h1><p class="wb-hero-sub">Every MLS property auto-loaded, plus an AI assistant that builds and edits your pages from a single sentence. AI SEO, lead capture, landing &amp; area pages, all built in - no developer, no hosting, no headache.</p><div class="wb-hero-ctas"><a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Build my agency site &rarr;</a><a href="#xml" class="btn btn-secondary on-dark btn-large">I already have a site</a></div><div class="wb-hero-price"><span class="wb-hero-price-badge">&#10003; Free to build &amp; preview</span><span class="wb-hero-price-then">then <strong>50 credits</strong>/mo (about €50) when you publish &middot; cancel anytime</span></div><p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:14px;color:#b8c9cb"><a href="https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/website-builder/" target="_blank" style="color:#6fe5d3;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(111,229,211,.45);padding-bottom:2px">&#128214; New here? How to use the Website Builder &rarr;</a></p></div><div class="wb-hero-visual"><a href="https://your-domain-here.estate-agency.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://info.propertylist.es/email-images/originals/email-mock-website-builder.png?v=20260514" alt="PropertyList Website Builder" /></a></div></div></div></header>

<section class="wb-trust"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-trust-grid"><div><div class="wb-trust-num">2,000+</div><div class="wb-trust-label">Spanish agents</div></div><div><div class="wb-trust-num">40,000+</div><div class="wb-trust-label">Community network</div></div><div><div class="wb-trust-num">Unlimited</div><div class="wb-trust-label">Listings &amp; pages</div></div><div><div class="wb-trust-num">€0</div><div class="wb-trust-label">Setup. Forever.</div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-bento wb-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-section-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 class="wb-section-h2">A website that builds <em>itself.</em></h2><p class="wb-lead">Three steps. No code. No agency quotes. No waiting weeks for a developer to update a single price.</p></div><div class="wb-bento-grid"><div class="wb-bento-card"><div class="wb-bento-num">1</div><h3>Pick a layout, or just describe it</h3><p>Start from a clean, modern template, then drag-and-drop blocks to make it yours - or simply tell the AI assistant what you want and watch it build.</p></div><div class="wb-bento-card"><div class="wb-bento-num">2</div><h3>MLS Properties, auto-loaded</h3><p>Every property already in PropertyList appears on your site - with photos, descriptions, prices, and location data. No need to lift a finger.</p></div><div class="wb-bento-card"><div class="wb-bento-num">3</div><h3>Publish &amp; capture leads</h3><p>Hit publish. Enquiries land in your CRM the moment a buyer fills the form. AI writes SEO meta for every page, automatically.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-ai wb-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-ai-grid"><div class="wb-ai-text"><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#6fe5d3">New &middot; AI website assistant</p><h2 class="wb-section-h2 on-dark">Don't build it. <em>Just describe it.</em></h2><p class="wb-lead" style="color:#b8c9cb">Type what you want in plain English and your site rewrites itself - copy, colours, fonts, whole sections. No blocks to drag, no menus to learn. Every change is a draft until you publish, so you can experiment with zero risk.</p><ul class="wb-feature-list wb-feature-list-dark"><li>Rewrite any page from a single sentence</li><li>Change your colours, fonts and tone in seconds</li><li>Add sections - testimonials, an FAQ, a contact form - just by asking</li><li>AI also writes your SEO meta titles and FAQ content</li><li>Works in English and Spanish - nothing goes live until you say so</li></ul><a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/website-builder" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Try the AI builder free &rarr;</a></div><div class="wb-ai-visual"><div class="wb-ai-chat"><div class="wb-ai-chat-head"><span class="wb-ai-spark">&#10022;</span> Edit with AI</div><div class="wb-ai-prompt">"Make the hero say <strong>'Your home on the Costa del Sol'</strong>, add a testimonials section near the bottom, and switch the colours to navy and gold."</div><div class="wb-ai-chips"><span>Punchier headline</span><span>Add testimonials</span><span>Navy &amp; gold</span></div><div class="wb-ai-status"><span class="wb-ai-dot"></span> Updating your site&hellip;</div><div class="wb-ai-result"><div class="wb-ai-result-h">Your home on the Costa del Sol</div><div class="wb-ai-result-p">Trusted local experts - browse every villa, apartment and townhouse, updated live from the MLS.</div><div class="wb-ai-result-bar"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="wb-feature-row"><div class="wb-feature-text"><p class="eyebrow">Visual builder</p><h3>Design like a pro, <em>without one.</em></h3><p>Real drag-and-drop. Add a hero, a property carousel, a contact block, a video, a map - drop, position, done. Live preview as you build.</p><ul class="wb-feature-list"><li>Block-based editor with hero, headings, gallery, forms, video</li><li>Custom HTML when you need full control</li><li>Brand colours and typography applied site-wide</li><li>Save drafts, preview live, publish when ready</li></ul></div><div class="wb-feature-visual"><a href="https://your-domain-here.estate-agency.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="https://info.propertylist.es/email-images/originals/email-mock-devices-example.png?v=20260514" alt="Website Builder drag-and-drop editor" /></a><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:#7a8a8c"><a href="https://your-domain-here.estate-agency.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">your-domain-here.estate-agency.co &rarr;</a></p></div></div>
<div class="wb-feature-row"><div class="wb-feature-text"><p class="eyebrow">AI SEO &amp; geo pages</p><h3>Rank where your buyers <em>actually search.</em></h3><p>Every page - including each property and each location - gets AI-generated meta titles and descriptions optimised for the way buyers really search. The platform builds geo-targeted pages for the areas you cover so you appear in local results without writing a word.</p><ul class="wb-feature-list"><li>AI-written meta titles and descriptions for every page</li><li>Auto-generated location pages: Marbella, Estepona, Mijas, anywhere you list</li><li>Schema markup built in for property listings</li><li>Updated automatically as your MLS changes</li></ul></div><div class="wb-feature-visual"><div class="wb-visual-box"><div class="wb-browser-frame"><div class="wb-browser-bar"><span class="wb-browser-dot r"></span><span class="wb-browser-dot y"></span><span class="wb-browser-dot g"></span><span class="wb-browser-url">your-domain-here.estate-agency.co</span></div><div style="padding:28px 24px"><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;color:#0d2b2e;margin-bottom:8px">Villas for sale in Marbella</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#4a5b5d;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.5">Browse 248 luxury villas in Marbella from €485,000 to €8.5M. Updated daily from the PropertyList MLS.</div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:12px"><div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dac8ad,#ae9c82);height:70px;border-radius:8px"></div><div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9bbcc8,#5f8aa2);height:70px;border-radius:8px"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="wb-feature-row"><div class="wb-feature-text"><p class="eyebrow">Lead capture</p><h3>Every enquiry, <em>straight to your CRM.</em></h3><p>Embedded forms, exit-intent popups, property enquiry buttons - they all feed directly into the PropertyList CRM. Your team sees the lead the moment it lands. No Zapier. No spreadsheets. No leads slipping through.</p><ul class="wb-feature-list"><li>Embedded contact forms anywhere on the site</li><li>Property enquiry buttons on every listing page</li><li>Lead capture popups with custom triggers</li><li>Auto-assigned to staff in your CRM with full source tracking</li></ul></div><div class="wb-feature-visual"><div class="wb-visual-box"><div class="wb-lead-card"><div class="wb-lead-tag">NEW LEAD &bull; 12 SEC AGO</div><div class="wb-lead-name">Sarah Mitchell</div><div class="wb-lead-email">sarah.m@email.com &middot; +44 7700 900124</div><div class="wb-lead-quote">"Interested in the 3-bed in Estepona Hills. When can I view?"</div><div class="wb-lead-pills"><span class="wb-pill-teal">Auto-assigned</span><span class="wb-pill">Source: Website</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="wb-feature-row"><div class="wb-feature-text"><p class="eyebrow">Make it yours</p><h3>Video hero, custom domain, <em>your brand throughout.</em></h3><p>Add a full-bleed video to your homepage. Connect your custom domain in minutes. Switch themes without losing content. Your site looks like yours - because it is.</p><div class="wb-pill-set"><span class="wb-pill">Video hero sections</span><span class="wb-pill">Custom domain</span><span class="wb-pill">Brand colours &amp; fonts</span><span class="wb-pill">Custom HTML blocks</span><span class="wb-pill">Mobile-perfect by default</span><span class="wb-pill">Footer branding</span><span class="wb-pill">Cookie banner</span></div></div><div class="wb-feature-visual"><div class="wb-visual-box" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2b2e,#1a3f43);padding:0;overflow:hidden"><div style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a3b3d,#0d2b2e);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px;text-align:center;color:#fff"><div><div style="width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px"><div style="width:0;height:0;border-style:solid;border-width:14px 0 14px 22px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #fff;margin-left:4px"></div></div><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px">Costa Homes</div><div style="font-size:13px;opacity:.7;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase">Luxury Property Specialists</div></div></div></div></div></div>
