<section id="pricing" class="wb-pricing wb-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-section-head"><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#6fe5d3">Honest pricing</p><h2 class="wb-section-h2 on-dark">Pay for what you use. <em>Nothing more.</em></h2><p class="wb-lead">A simple base plan, plus optional add-ons in credits. Add what you need, drop what you don't, when you want.</p></div><div class="wb-price-grid-3"><div class="wb-pricing-card"><div class="wb-pricing-badge">Start here</div><div class="wb-pricing-name">Website Builder</div><div class="wb-pricing-tagline">Everything you need to launch.</div><div class="wb-pricing-anchor">A custom agency website normally costs <span class="wb-anchor-strike">thousands</span> to build and takes <span class="wb-anchor-strike">weeks</span>. Yours is live today.</div><div class="wb-pricing-price">50 credits<span class="unit">/month</span></div><ul class="wb-pricing-features"><li><strong>3 pages</strong> - homepage, about, contact, landing or area pages</li><li>Drag-and-drop builder with content blocks</li><li>Hero header, forms, custom HTML blocks</li><li>Your brand colours and fonts site-wide</li><li>All your MLS properties auto-loaded</li><li>Hosting and SSL included</li><li>Build and preview free, only pay when published</li><li>Cancel anytime, no contract</li></ul><div class="wb-pricing-cta"><a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/website-builder" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Start building free &rarr;</a></div><p class="wb-pricing-note"><strong>✓ Build and preview free.</strong> 50 credits/month start only when you publish.</p></div><div class="wb-pricing-aside"><div class="wb-addon-card"><h4>Power-ups, <em>à la carte.</em></h4><p class="wb-addon-intro">Add only what your agency needs. Switch on, switch off, never pay for features you don't use.</p><ul class="wb-addon-list"><li><div class="wb-addon-name">AI keyword &amp; meta<small>SEO-optimised meta on every page</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">5/mo</span></li><li><div class="wb-addon-name">Monthly email digest<small>New listings sent to your contacts</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">5/mo</span></li><li><div class="wb-addon-name">Popup lead capture<small>Exit-intent and timed popups to your CRM</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">8/mo</span></li><li><div class="wb-addon-name">AI FAQ<small>Auto-generated FAQ sections per page</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">8/mo</span></li><li><div class="wb-addon-name">Custom domain<small>your-agency.com instead of our subdomain</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">20/mo</span></li><li><div class="wb-addon-name">Extra pages<small>Click "Add page" anytime</small></div><span class="wb-addon-price">Pay-as-you-go</span></li></ul><div class="wb-addon-footer"><strong>Prices in credits.</strong> New add-ons released regularly - AI tools, integrations, more.</div></div><div class="wb-credit-info"><h4>What's a credit?</h4><p>One credit works out at one euro or less depending on the pack. Top up any time, or <strong>buy in bulk for a discount</strong>. Credits never expire and apply across every add-on in your account.</p><div class="wb-credit-rate"><span>1 credit</span><span class="equals">&asymp;</span><span>1€</span></div></div></div></div><div class="wb-referral"><div class="wb-referral-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#00ae9a">Don't want to pay?</p><h3>Earn your credits. <em>Just share PropertyList.</em></h3><p>Every agent has a unique referral link. Share it with another agency - the moment they sign up, credits land in both your accounts. Real money, real platform credit, no strings.</p><p class="wb-referral-cta"><strong>Refer enough agencies and your platform pays for itself.</strong></p></div><div class="wb-referral-numbers"><div class="wb-referral-num-card"><div class="wb-referral-amount">20 credits</div><div class="wb-referral-who">You earn</div></div><div class="wb-referral-num-card"><div class="wb-referral-amount">10 credits</div><div class="wb-referral-who">They get</div></div></div></div></div><div class="wb-referral-cta-link"><a href="https://agents.propertylist.es/referrals" class="btn btn-secondary">Start referring &rarr;</a></div></section>
<section id="xml" class="wb-xml wb-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-xml-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Already have a website?</p><h2 class="wb-section-h2">Keep your site. <em>Get every property.</em></h2><p class="wb-lead" style="margin-bottom:20px">Import every PropertyList property into your existing website with a live XML feed - and push it to any other portal you work with, at the same time.</p><p style="color:#4a5b5d;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:18px">Your site stays yours. Your listings stay synced. Updates happen in real time, automatically. No manual uploads. No stale data. No admin.</p><ul class="wb-feature-list"><li>XML feed - every PropertyList listing</li><li>Distribute to your own site <strong>and</strong> any other portal you use</li><li>Sales, long-term rentals, holiday rentals and new developments/off-plan - all included</li><li>Setup support included</li></ul></div><div class="wb-xml-card"><div class="wb-xml-toggle" id="xmlToggle"><div class="wb-xml-toggle-option" data-period="monthly">Monthly<span class="save" style="visibility:hidden">.</span></div><div class="wb-xml-toggle-option active" data-period="annual">Annual<span class="save">SAVE 70€</span></div></div><div id="xml-price-display"><p style="font-size:13px;color:#7a8a8c;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:4px">XML Feed - Annual</p><div class="wb-xml-price-row"><span class="wb-xml-price" id="xml-price-value">350€</span><span class="wb-xml-price-unit" id="xml-price-unit">/year</span></div><p class="wb-xml-price-detail" id="xml-price-detail">Less than 30€/month &middot; Save 70€</p></div><div class="wb-pricing-cta"><a href="https://agents.propertylist.es" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get the XML feed &rarr;</a></div><p class="wb-pricing-note" style="margin-top:16px">Cancel anytime &middot; Setup included &middot; No contract</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-mcp-strip"><div class="wrap"><div class="wb-mcp-grid"><div class="wb-mcp-text"><p class="eyebrow">For the technically inclined</p><h3>Your site has an API your developers will appreciate.</h3><p>Every website we build comes with access to the PropertyList MCP server - the same Model Context Protocol layer powering AI agents like Claude, Cursor and Perplexity. Your developers can query live MLS data directly: search, location matching, area market summaries, and full listing details, through one standard interface.</p><div class="wb-mcp-tools"><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>search_properties</strong><span>Structured search by location, beds, price, type</span></div><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>find_properties_by_description</strong><span>Natural-language matching for buyers</span></div><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>area_market_summary</strong><span>Median price, per m2, bedroom-band counts</span></div><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>autocomplete_location</strong><span>Place names to PropertyList area IDs</span></div><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>get_property</strong><span>Full listing detail by reference</span></div><div class="wb-mcp-tool"><strong>list_agencies</strong><span>Top agencies in an area by active listings</span></div></div><p class="wb-mcp-link"><a href="https://mcp.propertylist.es" target="_blank">Explore the MCP docs &rarr;</a></p></div><div class="wb-mcp-terminal"><div class="wb-terminal-header"><span class="wb-terminal-dot r"></span><span class="wb-terminal-dot y"></span><span class="wb-terminal-dot g"></span><span class="wb-terminal-title">Claude Desktop — propertylist mcp</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-body"><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-comment">// Connect to PropertyList MCP</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-key">"mcpServers"</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: {</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent"><span class="wb-t-key">"propertylist"</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: {</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent2"><span class="wb-t-key">"url"</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: </span><span class="wb-t-str">"https://mcp.propertylist.es/mcp"</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent"><span class="wb-t-punct">}</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-punct">}</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-spacer"></div><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-comment">// Search for villas in Marbella</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-fn">search_properties</span><span class="wb-t-punct">({</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent"><span class="wb-t-key">location</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: </span><span class="wb-t-str">"Marbella"</span><span class="wb-t-punct">,</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent"><span class="wb-t-key">property_type</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: </span><span class="wb-t-str">"villa"</span><span class="wb-t-punct">,</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line wb-t-indent"><span class="wb-t-key">min_beds</span><span class="wb-t-punct">: </span><span class="wb-t-num">3</span></div><div class="wb-terminal-line"><span class="wb-t-punct">})</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wb-faq wb-section"><div class="narrow"><div class="wb-section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions?</p><h2 class="wb-section-h2">Everything <em>you might be wondering.</em></h2></div><div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>Can AI really build my site for me?</summary><p>Yes. Open Edit with AI, describe what you want in plain English - "add a section about our rental management service and make the headline warmer" - and the assistant rewrites the page, adjusts your colours and fonts, or adds whole sections in seconds. Every change is a draft, so you can refine it and only publish when you are happy. You stay in full control; the AI just does the heavy lifting.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>How long does it take to launch a site?</summary><p>Most agencies launch in 1 day or 2. Pick a layout, brand it, point your domain - and your MLS properties are already there. No content to upload, no developer to brief, no waiting.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>Do I need to upload my properties manually?</summary><p>No. Every property already in your PropertyList account appears on your site automatically. Add a property in your CRM and it's on your site within minutes - prices, photos, descriptions, the lot.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>What if I want to use my own domain?</summary><p>Connect your own domain - your-agency.com - in minutes. We handle SSL and hosting automatically. If you don't have a domain yet, we can help you register one.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>I already have a website. Can I still use PropertyList?</summary><p>Yes. The XML feed (35 credits/month or €350/year) feeds every PropertyList property straight into your existing website. The same feed can also push to other portals you work with. <a href="#xml">See XML feed details &rarr;</a></p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>What happens if I cancel?</summary><p>Your site reverts back to the free MicroSite at the end of your billing period. No cancellation fee, no commitment. You keep your domain. You can come back any time.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>Is the SEO actually any good?</summary><p>The AI writes meta titles and descriptions tuned for the way buyers in Spain actually search - "villa con piscina en Marbella" rather than generic real estate copy. Schema markup is built in for every listing. Auto-generated location pages cover the areas you list in. We don't promise rankings (no one honest can), but we give you the technical foundation most agency sites lack.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>How do I get leads from my site to my CRM?</summary><p>Automatically. Every enquiry form, popup, and property enquiry button feeds directly into the PropertyList CRM with source tracking. Auto-assign rules send each lead to the right agent on your team.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>Do I need to be technical to use it?</summary><p>Not at all. The builder is drag-and-drop - if you can move a slide around in PowerPoint, you can build a page. For agents who do want full control, custom HTML blocks are available.</p></details></div><div class="wb-faq-item"><details><summary>What schema markup is included?</summary><p>Every site ships with structured data for RealEstateAgent, Location, FAQPage, BreadcrumbList, and WebSite schema. All built automatically - no code, no plugins, no SEO expert needed. You show up in Google rich snippets and AI overviews without extra work.</p></details></div></div></div></section>
